        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-29T05:41:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Sentinels totally only count as 1 for determining the value of (H). While they have four Character Cards that are targets, the hero deck belongs to The Sentinels, which would be the \"Hero\".&nbsp;</p>",
